nt=\"normal\">∣</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\psi|^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>","key":"NEwRcsLTQY"},{"type":"text","value":" 给出在空间中找到粒子的概率密度。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"P1T0Bqrtx5"}],"key":"pwHAeYYlFL"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"但我们还缺少最关键的一环：波函数 ","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"p4Jh5L6pOs"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"\\psi","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span>","key":"YiHnhZPKrn"},{"type":"text","value":" 本身是怎么来的？它满足什么方程？给定一个具体的物理系统(比如氢原子)，我们如何从第一性原理出发，推导出所有允许的能级和对应的波函数？没有这个方程，波函数就只是一个抽象的数学对象，无法与具体的物理系统挂钩。德布罗意告诉我们粒子是波，但没有给出波的运动方程。玻尔告诉我们能级是离散的，但没有给出计算能级的通用方法。量子力学在1925年之前还只是一堆散落的概念碎片，缺少一个将它们统一起来的核心算法。","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"JBGI6JcO1L"}],"key":"nSEZ5uu40y"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"硅基视角：物理引擎","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"eqeVGjL6ua"}],"identifier":"id","label":"硅基视角：物理引擎","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"tEKyF8rwZ5"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"在计算机游戏和虚拟现实的世界中，有一种叫做\"物理引擎\"(physics engine)的核心软件组件。物理引擎的工作是：给定虚拟世界中所有物体的初始状态(位置、速度、质量)以及作用在它们之间的力(重力、弹力、摩擦力)，计算出所有物体在每个时刻的状态。物理引擎不关心物体长什么样、颜色是什么——它只关心状态如何随时间演化。你输入初始条件和力的规则，它输出轨迹。Unity 引擎中的 Rigidbody 组件、Unreal 引擎中的 PhysX 模块，本质上都在做同一件事：求解牛顿方程 ","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"to5i8nEg92"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"F = ma","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = ma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span></span></span></span>","key":"czu7k2uylp"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"lFPMmljhvp"}],"key":"bP8MR