pan class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05764em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span>","key":"fJ0yp8KMpt"},{"type":"text","value":"。这个数学结构在计算机科学中无处不在：Google 的 PageRank 是一个特征值问题，主成分分析(PCA)是一个特征值问题，量子化学中的分子轨道计算也是一个特征值问题。掌握了薛定谔方程，你不仅获得了量子力学的核心工具，也获得了一种在科学与工程中普遍适用的数学思维。","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"GyjlvcGnjg"}],"key":"vp2lGaRVWs"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本章回答这个核心问题。1926年薛定谔建立的波动方程——薛定谔方程——是量子力学的核心算法，它的地位恰如牛顿第二定律 ","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"FaAImDmEEZ"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"F = ma","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = ma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span></span></span></span>","key":"V8kzDUuVQD"},{"type":"text","value":" 在经典力学中的地位：给定系统的势能函数(编码在哈密顿算符中)，薛定谔方程就能输出所有允许的量子态及其能量。我们将首先讨论薛定谔方程的物理动机和数学结构，追溯薛定谔如何从光学与力学的类比中获得灵感，以及他的方程如何自然地产生能量量子化——不需要任何人为的假设，量子化从边界条件中自动浮现。然后介绍算符作为从波函数中提取物理信息的工具，理解为什么动量变成了微分运算，为什么物理量变成了矩阵，以及对易关系如何编码了不确定性。最后将这套形式体系应用于氢原子，求解出完整的波函数，揭示量子数 ","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"I8UyH6JOc6"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"(n, l, m)","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n, l, m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>","key":"INQM4l7Cql"},{"type":"text","value":" 如何定义电子云的三维几何结构，将第二章玻尔模型中那个单薄的能级公式 ","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"TM6kqTJ8oa"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"E_n = -13.6/n^2","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},